{"id": "unknown-2026-09-20-003", "date": "2026-09-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "HKC ships the first batch of flexible smartphone OLED panels produced at its H6 5.5-Gen line in Shenzhen", "content": "<p>Shenzhen-based display maker <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/hkc\">HKC</a> announced that it has shipped the first batch of flexible smartphone OLED panels out of its <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/royoles-55-gen-flexible-amoled-line-sold-69-million-likely-hkc\">H6 5.5-Gen AMOLED production line</a> in Shenzhen, a production line it has acquired from Royole early last year.</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2025-10/HKC-factory-Miany", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/hkc-ships-first-batch-flexible-smartphone-oled-panels-produced-its-h6-55-gen", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-20-004", "date": "2026-09-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["panel_price", "oled_penetration", "it_panel_demand"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["increase"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Omdia: OLED monitor panel makers to shift focus to the enterprise market instead of gaming", "content": "<p>In recent years, we have seen increased demand for OLED monitor panels, mainly from the gaming industry, as OLED makers managed to offer panels that offer high resolution, high refresh rates, and an excellent image quality.&nbsp;</p><div class=\"align-center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/2026-09/Gaming-Enterprise-OLED-monitor-panel-shipments-2025-2033-Omdia-OLED-Info.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/omdia-oled-monitor-panel-makers-shift-focus-enterprise-market-instead-gaming", "type": "rss"}]}
